#: scenario7:scenario7_89A6D2BA_A23B_4F01_B560_DA41FEB41DDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e35239bc7055dd6a53e4ee0d03c3d7487352bbc2c6367cbe8805000c82d9cc4d
#. default-sha256: 90fb8d60f6d017adb11c374b4833ef69c3c00fddec3862604f7a1217de8dcf6c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_89A6D2BA_A23B_4F01_B560_DA41FEB41DDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Heavy clouds filled the sky, blocking out the sun and giving the impression of late evening "
"all throughout the day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Des nuages lourds envahissaient le ciel, bloquaient la lumière du soleil : toute la journée, "
"on avait l’impression que c’était le crépuscule."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EA98D4F6_2D01_49A2_9CC9_08B6B91AF57B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ede5c39ee42ea8868ade6c9c0597cbdbe03acfa9054d7c04d3a9d085f1b6eb79
#. default-sha256: dd1e42249427ed2db00d46578b2a6e4c37f0461246d75a7dd07c08d6ec87192b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EA98D4F6_2D01_49A2_9CC9_08B6B91AF57B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Which meant I could only go outside on days when the weather made most everyone else gloomy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce qui signifiait que je ne pouvais sortir que les jours où le temps déprimait tout le monde."

#: scenario7:scenario7_62BE9474_951A_4850_AB0B_48F8BF4C4213
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97a2e2a316ef24cfab2f3cbe5c69ff82d1d2b7b95c7b471437630434dbfae0ea
