msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0CC24CFF_DFBA_42EC_A670_E87AED53CB32"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And it also"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Voilà qui acheva"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7FC60674_11DD_464C_AB5F_B4B8A969DD1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eabb3a77dedeef2b9ed0c9545bc49aa12ef142a1725132381a3738fe4bf410dd
#. default-sha256: 614800b2a024a6370c1a465b5b55d26bc31cd8cdad960e17daa52f2dcfb336e5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7FC60674_11DD_464C_AB5F_B4B8A969DD1D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫She was a noble girl by the name of Aimee Joubert. "
"⟪k:9⟫Though only fifteen, she was the very image of refined—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫polished to a shine."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫C’était une fille de la noblesse qui répondait au "
"nom d’Aimée Joubert. ⟪k:9⟫Elle avait beau avoir seulement quinze ans, elle était l’image même du "
"raffinement —⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫ sophistiquée jusqu’au bout des ongles."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CE727012_CD18_480E_AAB1_20A8B589F913
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a92b25c8dd4ff31a88201dd31f60baa76429be4a67157c0007d1e74ef6371530
#. default-sha256: a692204e6881a1667a133e1ec4f7f1688432f9a2750575c2bcc44c6e42f41251
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CE727012_CD18_480E_AAB1_20A8B589F913"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It came out of nowhere, ⟪k:1⟫and it seemed I was the only one who didn’t know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce fut une vraie surprise, ⟪k:1⟫et il semblait que j’étais la seule à ne pas être au courant."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4C7E4720_9197_41B4_925D_5BAB63DFAD73
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3563931d908dd034a4f87f30273616b857712a99f6e321554166c97c550f5f88
#. default-sha256: fd792b9da40c8c5fd92b41a917975efff400f46af45d4fe5cd3c3e95c3e824d2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4C7E4720_9197_41B4_925D_5BAB63DFAD73"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That evening, when the family gathered around the table for supper, Aimee was there too. "
"⟪k:1⟫And they prepared an extravagant feast for the occasion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce soir-là, lorsque la famille se réunit à table pour le souper, Aimée dîna avec nous. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Et ils avaient préparé un extravagant festin pour l’occasion."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2451AB79_1AEF_4C56_B230_8116FEE02F34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 337fe7e81a157aa1266ecaad20982279ff8f513c02b155acc4a00c352101a0c6
#. default-sha256: 621b54f602a1352c4e42ed41e30ed7a9cfd388229dcaef3cecacbbb6ea2e33ab
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2451AB79_1AEF_4C56_B230_8116FEE02F34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother was pleased to have another girl around."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mère était ravie d’avoir une autre fille à ses côtés."

#: scenario7:scenario7_64269743_0DF3_4D1E_9780_A9512BF3F822
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c63910c0a5e8f1a46db5a7ccc3cf7910eca513a0fbb2053b979c8fb97ce224f5
#. default-sha256: 80e941af98174ad6d28666b30266407f7d2edd5ce23e001a5e43f7da880d5659
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_64269743_0DF3_4D1E_9780_A9512BF3F822"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or, more specifically, she was relieved to have found someone other than my brothers for me "
"to spend time with."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ou, plus précisément, elle était soulagée d’avoir trouvé quelqu’un d’autre que mes frères "
"pour mes fréquentations."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AFA09C65_DDDD_4F1D_8E4F_B475801780C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b529439c85af334468b6d5c4df267fac99d9bdf3a9eb4a3c94769c9f66ce016
#. default-sha256: e2655f57a484b0b10faf3ad20bee70952e50a98f0fa139dc780023df0929a962
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AFA09C65_DDDD_4F1D_8E4F_B475801780C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I felt much less... ⟪k:1⟫suffocated around her than my mother."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫avec elle, je me sentais... ⟪k:1⟫c’était moins étouffant qu’avec ma mère."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FD5E8DB1_8AFB_4E85_A513_2395D28F0324
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd4d9e4438f89afb4b391b178e9f3ca7de85bfe851422a66febccabf1f19462a
#. default-sha256: 59ab0569638598325e257eb8b9e6508c8fcc12d5c54c5a85de6c1fb47dddbee1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FD5E8DB1_8AFB_4E85_A513_2395D28F0324"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A din the likes of which I had never heard in my life filled the great hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un vacarme tel que je n’en avais jamais entendu de toute ma vie emplissait le grand hall."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FB6993ED_C256_4432_A9BF_47990377BB60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb88f5d5f649f04a5d57925140e7d0674dab2ab740c056b9e5817f84ed59b70e
#. default-sha256: a0d7e26c80a429a0e71ba6b1f9f40c3446facc7053c2764ae4dfebaae6ca7a21
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FB6993ED_C256_4432_A9BF_47990377BB60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everywhere I looked, there were people, people, people."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Partout où je regardais, il y avait des gens, des gens et encore des gens."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AE3C5140_E779_4907_BA91_7508DDAFC3DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 119577110327f8b16eda57359fc3caf4bdc80654d1a7c29e252ed3996800149b
#. default-sha256: fb71ff1e1de04d087315160388a9ea07cd6d888990853bbbdb1c37c98005ba22
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AE3C5140_E779_4907_BA91_7508DDAFC3DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Voices from all directions."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Des voix, dans toutes les directions."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9326FF57_90A9_44C3_9FA6_46CDCF4F59BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c5f937fc2f0d342907744dec6951108630b4ac20b95ccbeea08938b5aa01791
#. default-sha256: b82934656d1aadcc2f94c46960a0ee4941d37a0653d1bfe3a1d2ab66e5364204
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9326FF57_90A9_44C3_9FA6_46CDCF4F59BB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Hey Dee, I feel like we’re critically short on waiters.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫This don’t look good for us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Hé Di, je crois qu’on manque cruellement de serveurs.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"C’est mauvais pour nous, ça."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4AB296AE_1FCD_47C1_AE8A_959666A52A0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9be9e1cadd2c128ce1aba8b96773d0b0aceb18a25bcf4598a27918dfd64a1ea9
#. default-sha256: a64f0de0e7202ec7a4b8b13a7ec9ed56f0a101f185318375186b137673f91167
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4AB296AE_1FCD_47C1_AE8A_959666A52A0A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫They’re ⟪k:2⟫artistes⟪k:3⟫ like me. I met them at the court.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Let’s see, we "
"have some painters, composers, sculptors, troubadours, poets, writers, you name it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ce sont des ⟪k:2⟫artistes⟪k:3⟫, comme moi. On s’est rencontré à la cour.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"Voyons voir, il y a des peintres, des compositeurs, des sculpteurs, des troubadours, des poètes, "
"des écrivains, en veux-tu en voilà."

#: scenario7:scenario7_371CF7E6_AB99_46C2_A916_9B22E1E37DAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40edf08bb9e6f073a503af159bd7187c3018244bd4381e55d6d44255b3cc0f6f
#. default-sha256: f984ff4cf4c0363c3dc7f32a337e9eabf447cee80d28d5072d805e4f6cd376bf
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_371CF7E6_AB99_46C2_A916_9B22E1E37DAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫None of them have any connection to the Jouberts ⟪k:2⟫or⟪k:3⟫ Bollingers!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aucun d’entre eux n’a de liens avec les Joubert, ⟪k:2⟫ou même⟪k:3⟫ les Bollinger !"

#: scenario7:scenario7_03A91D8F_173E_4C91_B91D_251A71428750
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68f5a1ee50a464235c424083978f114273b1ee215b6ab9453aea5235e0c524d9
#. default-sha256: f40f39dca9513641579dc80d79dda68ab2a71710928e4cb226e7f47bc7169cc5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_03A91D8F_173E_4C91_B91D_251A71428750"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Off in one corner, several men—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫presumably Georges’s friends—"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫gathered in a circle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Dans un coin, plusieurs hommes —⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ des amis de Georges, "
"j’imagine —⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫ se rassemblèrent en cercle."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BBBF8C7F_DC36_4327_B785_C5D10320209F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ce061056c3eb61420b28da65d9e4095fc62915ebac6fd54c6f2719c555d6d46
#. default-sha256: ab79727d5989acc53303bcf2b529c2a8cf97ab2767b5a516a0c95699d6fb38dc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BBBF8C7F_DC36_4327_B785_C5D10320209F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They stood out from the other aristocrats, both in appearance and the air they gave off. "
"⟪k:1⟫The clothes they wore. The embroidery hidden beneath their jacket cuffs."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ils ne ressemblaient pas aux autres aristocrates ; ils n’en avaient ni l’apparence ni les "
"manières. ⟪k:1⟫Leurs vêtements. Les broderies cachées sous leurs manchettes."

#: scenario7:scenario7_01049DFE_0896_43B2_81A6_1E04BA9F3200
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ba885294f3e04e3fa5011dd98cae68cfe2a6997fd7b8c360822efd3e87c030c
#. default-sha256: 7f1383352738e3f82a6f0b6d0b8ce8d99eaf9994d75d7127e9a6c4b1cf2ef468
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01049DFE_0896_43B2_81A6_1E04BA9F3200"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Their manner of speech. The way they held themselves. ⟪k:1⟫They were, simply put, a far cry "
"from the hardheaded Didier’s ideal party guests."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Leur façon de parler. Leur attitude. ⟪k:1⟫Ils étaient, pour faire simple, loin d’être les "
"invités parfaits aux yeux du pragmatique Didier."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6B76385C_D544_4488_9F4C_9DA809AEB49F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 025ad75c40152078dcdf33eeab5ec512af3e32777cc68a34dc19a446338e6d2e
#. default-sha256: 1312a221743693630016f68899cad333412b706d3413ba68864207a57d367aa5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6B76385C_D544_4488_9F4C_9DA809AEB49F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If they had been strangers, I doubt their paths would cross much—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫and if they "
"did, those intersections would be quite rocky."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫S’ils n’étaient pas nés dans la même famille, je doute fort que leurs routes se seraient "
"croisées un jour —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ et quand bien même, la rencontre aurait été plutôt abrupte."

