msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_731EAA52_F6C7_4A77_9829_D33EBA2154C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Think before you act, Georges.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What were you doing inviting people like that into "
"our home?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Réfléchis avant d’agir, Georges.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Qu’est-ce qui t’a pris d’inviter des gens pareils "
"chez nous ?!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0794717_90B7_4842_A4B5_5821DE9E76DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f93342a7d94ed1796231bd956be7d630877701bf9cc4fdb03ccbc1e2308eebd
