msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6196453A_A457_4F87_8764_022166054E43"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt a sickening warmth almost directly against my back. ⟪k:1⟫The man from the great hall "
"grabbed me by the wrists, spun me around, and pressed me against the wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je sentis une chaleur tout contre mon dos ; j’en eus la nausée. ⟪k:1⟫L’homme du grand hall "
"me prit par les poignets, me retourna et me plaqua au mur."

#: scenario7:scenario7_505D9FA8_9319_446A_9840_6285F0E571F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de1a9677cb47b399ad865e71570cb430fd0252b0acf9469458ea052ba568d70e
