#: scenario7:scenario7_EF7166F8_304B_4FE2_94D0_BA7A76E45179
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8892eda0466b192db95801170e7c059f0c0e85bde290b6dc43eb0215fa5f3ca
